WEBVTT

01:17.530 --> 01:21.240
Splendid swordsmanship.
He killed you.

01:22.120 --> 01:25.330
Are you so fond of that woman?

03:01.130 --> 03:05.180
<i>Episode 3 Forbidden Love.</i>

03:21.240 --> 03:24.370
Hey, guy, why don't
you do me instead?

03:31.420 --> 03:33.250
You're such a cold fish.

03:36.130 --> 03:41.590
I hate... being
ignored by a man!

04:16.460 --> 04:19.170
Why did you do that?

04:23.590 --> 04:26.600
Sorry. I should thank you.

04:37.310 --> 04:39.650
- Is it you, Kitsunebi?
- Yes, sir.

04:40.150 --> 04:41.790
Any word of Hiruko's news?

04:41.820 --> 04:48.630
Their ninjas are active, trying to
protect the Light Maiden from us.

04:48.660 --> 04:50.590
Protect? Heh.

04:50.620 --> 04:54.080
They want the power of
the Light for their own good.

04:54.500 --> 04:56.930
Kimon and Hiruko...

04:56.960 --> 04:59.770
Which one of us will
capture the Light Maiden?

04:59.800 --> 05:03.670
The time has come
to vanquish Hiruko.

05:36.710 --> 05:38.430
Hey, old geezer!

05:38.460 --> 05:40.010
It's Dakuan, not old geezer!

05:40.040 --> 05:41.890
All right, well, then,
geezer Dakuan.

05:41.920 --> 05:46.270
You're sure this Jubei guy is at the
inn on the other side of this mountain?

05:46.300 --> 05:53.490
According to the information I've
gathered, but he seems to be a fickle sort,

05:53.520 --> 05:55.700
so he may disappear again.

05:55.730 --> 05:58.780
You want a guy like
that to be a bodyguard?

05:58.810 --> 06:04.830
By the way, perhaps you know
the man named Jubei Kibagami?

06:04.860 --> 06:07.200
No, I do not know such a man.

06:14.370 --> 06:17.330
Jubei this, Jubei that.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.790
What's the matter?

06:46.320 --> 06:50.320
Light Maiden, come with us.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.280
Behind you!

07:01.830 --> 07:02.830
Go now!

07:05.130 --> 07:06.460
Go after them, Jyashi!

07:10.800 --> 07:12.440
Back, just as I thought.

07:12.470 --> 07:16.680
I will not let you Kimons
have the Light Maiden.

07:18.730 --> 07:21.190
Is that the only trick you know?

07:48.050 --> 07:50.300
He found us!

08:19.160 --> 08:21.330
Worked out pretty good.

08:30.210 --> 08:32.800
- Bastard!
- Could it be?

08:38.970 --> 08:41.270
What, this again?

08:42.520 --> 08:46.700
I guess everyone's ganging
up to stop me from sleeping.

08:46.730 --> 08:53.950
- You!
- JubeL You are Jubei Kibagami.

08:54.990 --> 08:59.530
That's right. I've
been looking for you.

09:02.910 --> 09:05.250
Are you one of them?

09:06.250 --> 09:09.600
No, I'm not. I want to hire you.

09:09.630 --> 09:11.090
Hire me?

09:13.420 --> 09:15.690
No, it's okay.

09:15.720 --> 09:17.770
Looks like we've got company.

09:17.800 --> 09:18.800
Huh?

09:24.930 --> 09:26.560
I-It's him!

09:27.440 --> 09:31.660
Light Maiden, this time
you will come with me.

09:31.690 --> 09:32.910
No, I won't.

09:32.940 --> 09:35.420
I am not the
so-called Light Maiden.

09:35.450 --> 09:39.120
You better be a little nicer
or you won't get any girls.

09:41.790 --> 09:44.510
You take care of him!

09:44.540 --> 09:45.580
What?

09:46.330 --> 09:47.330
I won't let you get away!

09:50.960 --> 09:53.510
Don't be too persistent.
People don't like that.

10:01.350 --> 10:02.930
Ouch.

10:13.650 --> 10:14.750
You!

10:14.780 --> 10:19.410
Quit staring. I'm not like that.

10:21.200 --> 10:25.790
How convenient. I will
take your Sacred Stone.

10:27.620 --> 10:28.590
You, too?

10:28.620 --> 10:32.260
Every single creature who sees
this Stone goes berserk over it.

10:32.290 --> 10:33.710
Sacred Stone?

10:41.220 --> 10:42.760
How impudent!

10:56.030 --> 10:57.240
C-Crap!

11:06.290 --> 11:07.660
Damn you.

11:38.480 --> 11:39.490
Disgusting.

11:57.380 --> 12:00.770
Get lost. Quit scurrying
around and get out of here.

12:00.800 --> 12:03.890
Don't be so cold. Help me.

12:05.550 --> 12:07.930
I know how well
you use your sword.

12:08.680 --> 12:12.270
It's a pity to kill such a fine
swordsman, but I have no choice.

12:47.720 --> 12:49.180
What's going on?

13:05.740 --> 13:08.660
I don't know what's going
on but you'll need to die again!

13:13.790 --> 13:15.620
An impressive blow.

13:31.390 --> 13:34.180
Dakuan, do you know
something of this?

13:35.100 --> 13:39.060
Who are those people
who call me Light Maiden?

13:41.440 --> 13:43.190
Why am I being chased?

13:49.990 --> 13:51.620
This way, Shigure!

14:03.210 --> 14:04.920
An illusion technique, perhaps.

14:14.020 --> 14:15.240
Are you okay, Jubei?

14:15.270 --> 14:17.310
Hey! Don't die!

14:17.810 --> 14:21.230
<i>Meanwhile, where's
the Sacred Stone?</i>

14:28.150 --> 14:31.950
When you witness our ninja
technique, it's time for you to die!

14:37.870 --> 14:40.290
You're alive! I'm so glad!

14:41.580 --> 14:44.300
Shut up! You were
trying to steal from me.

14:44.750 --> 14:47.590
See ya! Go make friends
with that guy over there.

14:47.970 --> 14:52.570
What? Hey, wait! Help me!

14:52.600 --> 14:54.940
Who cares?! I don't
owe you anything.

14:54.970 --> 14:56.890
You selfish jerk!

14:58.730 --> 15:00.730
Heh, you do well by yourself.

15:03.610 --> 15:05.480
Relentless, isn't he?

15:13.120 --> 15:14.750
What is that smoke?

15:14.780 --> 15:16.920
There's no time to wonder!

15:16.950 --> 15:18.550
Here he comes!

15:18.580 --> 15:21.590
Do something,
you trouble magnet!

15:21.620 --> 15:24.060
Sure, I'll do something.

15:24.090 --> 15:25.090
What?

15:25.420 --> 15:29.800
What do you get from killing me?

15:37.810 --> 15:38.810
See ya!

15:40.270 --> 15:41.640
I won't let you get away.

15:51.570 --> 15:52.780
Am I saved?

15:56.870 --> 15:59.330
Yeah, sort of.

16:01.500 --> 16:03.620
This happens to be
one of my specialties.

16:07.170 --> 16:11.340
This is your speciality?!

16:17.140 --> 16:18.310
See? It sort of worked out.

16:20.730 --> 16:24.700
For a trouble magnet,
you sure got lucky.

16:24.730 --> 16:26.480
And what are you
going to do now?

16:27.270 --> 16:28.980
I'm going to look for Shigure.

16:30.030 --> 16:31.570
Then what?

16:32.030 --> 16:33.030
Nothing.

16:33.650 --> 16:34.970
I'm just going to
hand this over.

16:36.200 --> 16:37.830
Are you sure that's it?

16:38.330 --> 16:39.540
Yep.

16:40.240 --> 16:41.830
Shigure is my meal ticket.

16:42.410 --> 16:44.330
I ain't sharing
anything with you.

16:46.290 --> 16:47.540
Do what you like.

16:51.670 --> 16:54.650
We're going! I
don't fancy that man.

16:54.680 --> 16:55.680
Me neither!

17:05.730 --> 17:09.080
Shigure. Are you all right?

17:09.110 --> 17:10.940
Shigure?

17:12.780 --> 17:15.880
Oh, you're fine.

17:15.910 --> 17:16.880
What's this?

17:16.910 --> 17:21.240
Oh, perhaps I used a
little too much gunpowder.

17:22.160 --> 17:27.380
Come on, hang onto my shoulder.

17:34.470 --> 17:35.630
<i>Over there.</i>

17:43.770 --> 17:47.310
You! You're still alive!

17:55.950 --> 17:56.950
Jubefl.

17:57.150 --> 17:59.620
Jubei, you're alive!

18:00.700 --> 18:02.160
What now?

18:02.620 --> 18:05.410
Now you're being
chased by that lovely lady.

18:06.790 --> 18:08.510
Stay out of this, Rengoku!

18:08.540 --> 18:10.300
I'll get him!

18:10.330 --> 18:12.470
Hey, what are you doing?

18:12.500 --> 18:14.260
We've got to get
away while we can!

18:22.310 --> 18:23.110
You stay out of this!

18:23.140 --> 18:25.400
You go after the Light Maiden.

18:25.430 --> 18:27.980
I'll leave the rest
to you, Jubei!

18:29.270 --> 18:30.480
How could they?

18:31.860 --> 18:32.860
Go, quickly!

18:35.740 --> 18:39.700
Rengoku! I'll kill you if
you can't leave us alone.

18:43.120 --> 18:44.910
This time, you're a dead man.

18:58.300 --> 19:00.680
This time, you're
showing up yourself, huh?

19:42.260 --> 19:46.940
That was quite a magic trick,
but use it more than once,

19:46.970 --> 19:48.470
and you'll give away the secret!

20:00.740 --> 20:04.870
I wonder if Jubei
was killed this time.

20:05.660 --> 20:06.780
JubeL.

20:07.580 --> 20:09.050
Jvashu.

20:09.080 --> 20:16.970
You'll be okay, Jyashi. I
will fix your body, don't worry.

20:17.000 --> 20:18.250
I will...

20:23.880 --> 20:28.010
It's all right, older sister.

20:29.930 --> 20:32.310
Jyashi... Jyashi!

20:36.480 --> 20:39.750
Damn you. You
took away my brother.

20:39.780 --> 20:43.780
Someday, I will kill you!

21:00.300 --> 21:02.810
Jubei! You're alive!

21:02.840 --> 21:05.150
I'm so glad! I was worried!

21:05.180 --> 21:06.760
Please take this.

21:14.390 --> 21:15.870
What is this?

21:15.900 --> 21:18.310
Something I don't need.

21:18.770 --> 21:19.770
I can't take this.

21:20.400 --> 21:25.580
There was a dying man whose last
wish was to have this delivered to you.

21:25.610 --> 21:27.070
It's yours now.

21:28.990 --> 21:31.160
From now on, ask
Grandpa to take care of you.

21:38.830 --> 21:40.340
Wait! Jubei!

21:41.210 --> 21:42.840
Don't be so smug!

21:43.510 --> 21:45.900
Are you running away?

21:45.930 --> 21:47.180
Jubefl.

23:29.820 --> 23:31.820
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:34.450 --> 23:37.450
Shigure doesn't want the Stone.

23:37.830 --> 23:40.830
Yet the Hiruko
and Kimon both do.

23:41.330 --> 23:44.170
And then there's Jubei,
Dakuan, and Tsubute...

23:44.460 --> 23:48.350
Though their ambitions
bring them together,

23:48.380 --> 23:53.110
the Dragon Stone will
bring about their end.

23:53.140 --> 23:56.560
Next time on Ninja
Scroll: Broken Stone.

23:56.680 --> 23:56.820
Witness.

23:56.850 --> 23:58.070
<i>Episode 4 Broken Stone Witness.</i>

23:58.100 --> 23:59.810
<i>Episode 4 Broken Stone</i>
